    "enUS": {
      "description": "Mountaineer Rockgar is looking for volunteers for a mission through Dun Algaz and into the Wetlands.  \n\nIf you want to get your boots wet in that soggy county to the north, then speak with Rockgar at Dun Algaz.  Dun Algaz is north up the road, beyond the guard tower.",
      "summary": "Speak with Mountaineer Rockgar.",
      "title": "Report to Mountaineer Rockgar",
